WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.040
My AI Assistant + Knowledge. Build an AI that knows your way of working and your sources.

00:05.040 --> 00:15.040
Create a private AI assistant with a name and clear custom instructions.

00:15.040 --> 00:27.040
Add a Knowledge file, select it for this version, then save instructions and models.

00:27.040 --> 00:39.040
Open a conversation, choose AI Assistant in the tools menu, and select your assistant.

00:39.040 --> 00:44.040
Ask a question. Three relevant Knowledge excerpts are used as reference material.
